IGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -37.5pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육여건 등을 고려하여 학과에서 전과 허가 인원 및 심사기준을 정할 수 있도록 개정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -37.5pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개정사유</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -37.5pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전과 허용인원이 과다하여 교육 여건의 저하 우려</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -37.5pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">심사기준 미공지로 전과 신청자 중 미동의자 민원 발생 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: